agnt-host
=========

This directory is derived from the desktop host (`remodex-host`) in the
Remodex project, originally authored by Stivy-01 and licensed under
the ISC License.

Upstream source: Stivy-01/remodex (https://github.com/Stivy-01/remodex)
Imported from:   Stivy-01/remodex@main, directory `remodex-host/`

Modifications relative to upstream:
  - Crate / package renamed from `remodex-host` to `agnt-host`; app
    identifier `com.remodex.host` -> `com.smeltery.agnt.host`.
  - Bundled bridge directory renamed `phodex-bridge` -> `agnt-bridge`;
    entry script `bin/remodex.js` -> `bin/agnt.js`; bundle manifest
    `remodex-bundle.json` -> `agnt-bundle.json`.
  - copy-bundled.mjs sources `../agnt-bridge` and `../relay` from this
    repository rather than the upstream layout.
  - Env-var prefixes updated:
      REMODEX_RELAY                     -> AGNT_RELAY
      REMODEX_PRINT_PAIRING_JSON        -> AGNT_PRINT_PAIRING_JSON
      REMODEX_HOST_UPDATE_TAG           -> AGNT_HOST_UPDATE_TAG
      REMODEX_HOST_UPDATE_BASE_URL      -> AGNT_HOST_UPDATE_BASE_URL
      REMODEX_HOST_UPDATE_INSTALLER_NAME -> AGNT_HOST_UPDATE_INSTALLER_NAME
  - Default remote-relay URL `wss://relay.remodex.app` replaced with the
    local-loopback default `ws://127.0.0.1:9000` (host is local-first;
    a hosted relay must be opted into explicitly).
  - Tauri updater endpoint repointed to `smeltery/agnt` releases. The
    minisign `pubkey` in `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` is a placeholder —
    a fresh keypair must be generated before any signed release.
  - License migrated from ISC to Apache-2.0 to match the rest of this
    repository.
  - User-facing strings rebranded to "Agnt Host" / "Agnt Pet".

The animated relay sprite under `public/pets/relay/` and the asset-
generation pipeline under `run-pet/` are copied as-is from upstream;
the sprite art remains attributable to its original author.

Application icons under `src-tauri/icons/` are inherited from upstream
and must be replaced with agnt-branded artwork before any public
release.
